                "motion_text": "That the Ottawa Police Services Board delegate authority to the Chair and Vice-Chair to approve:\n1.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0appointments in relation to any demonstrations or major events that may occur between July 24 and September 30, 2023. These appointments will be valid until September 30, 2023;\n2.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 any memorandums of understanding that are required by the Ottawa Police Service (OPS) to secure resources from other police services to assist with operational response to any demonstrations/events that may arise between July 24, 2023 and September 30, 2023.\nAny exercise of this delegated authority will be reported out at the next regular meeting of the Board, to be ratified as part of the minutes.",
